# condor_submit_dag supergranulation_haywood_neid.dag : SunSim at the times of the NEID exposures
#   1. one job per day of supergranulation_haywood_neid_days.txt: HMI epochs, corrected 45 s dopplergrams and JPL
#      velocities (Kitt Peak) of its NEID exposures (supergranulation_haywood_neid_day.sub)
#   2. all the days: window averages, simulations, comparison with NEID (supergranulation_haywood_neid_collect.sub; it
#      runs even if some days failed: only the complete days are used)
JOB days    supergranulation_haywood_neid_day.sub
JOB collect supergranulation_haywood_neid_collect.sub
PARENT days CHILD collect
SCRIPT POST days /bin/true
